{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EnvironmentValues\/openURL","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"openURL","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI0A9URLActionV","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/OpenURLAction","text":"OpenURLAction"},{"kind":"text","text":" { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Read this environment value to get an "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/OpenURLAction","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"instance for a given "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Environment","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". Call the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"instance to open a URL. You call the instance directly because it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"defines a "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/OpenURLAction\/callAsFunction(_:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" method that Swift"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"calls when you call the instance."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For example, you can open a web site when the user taps a button:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["struct OpenURLExample: View {","    @Environment(\\.openURL) private var openURL","","    var body: some View {","        Button {","            if let url = URL(string: \"https:\/\/www.example.com\") {","                openURL(url)","            }","        } label: {","            Label(\"Get Help\", systemImage: \"person.fill.questionmark\")","        }","    }","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If you want to know whether the action succeeds, add a completion","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"handler that takes a Boolean value. In this case, Swift implicitly","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"calls the ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/OpenURLAction\/callAsFunction(_:completion:)"},{"text":" method","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"instead. That method calls your completion handler after it determines","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"whether it can open the URL, but possibly before it finishes opening","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the URL. You can add a handler to the example above so that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it prints the outcome to the console:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["openURL(url) { accepted in","    print(accepted ? \"Success\" : \"Failure\")","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The system provides a default open URL action with behavior"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that depends on the contents of the URL. For example, the default"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"action opens a Universal Link in the associated app if possible,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or in the user’s default web browser if not."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You can also set a custom action using the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/View\/environment(_:_:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"view modifier. Any views that read the action from the environment,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"including the built-in ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Link"},{"text":" view and ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Text","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" views with markdown","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"links, or links in attributed strings, use your action. Initialize an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"action by calling the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/OpenURLAction\/init(handler:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" initializer with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a handler that takes a URL and returns an ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/OpenURLAction\/Result","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":":","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["Text(\"Visit [Example Company](https:\/\/www.example.com) for details.\")","    .environment(\\.openURL, OpenURLAction { url in","        handleURL(url) \/\/ Define this method to take appropriate action.","        return .handled","    })"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"SwiftUI translates the value that your custom action’s handler"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"returns into an appropriate Boolean result for the action call."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For example, a view that uses the action declared above"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"receives "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":" when calling the action, because the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"handler always returns "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/OpenURLAction\/Result\/handled","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EnvironmentValues"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/environmentvalues\/openurl"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An action that opens a URL."}],"metadata":{"title":"openURL","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Property","externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI17EnvironmentValuesV7openURLAA0A9URLActionVvp","modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"symbolKind":"property","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"openURL","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI0A9URLActionV","text":"OpenURLAction","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"extendedModule":"OpenSwiftUI"},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/Environment":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Environment"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/environment","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A property wrapper that reads a value from a view’s environment."}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"Environment","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Environment"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Environment"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/OpenURLAction/callAsFunction(_:)":{"title":"callAsFunction(_:)","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"callAsFunction"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation3URLV","text":"URL"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Opens a URL, following system conventions."}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/openurla